"P3036242912" "This is a good reminder of what happens when you owe the Family money."
// STEEL_ALLHOODS_DESTRUCTIBLECAR_ATTACKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1128191450" "I love senseless destruction, it just makes my day that much better."
// STEEL_ALLHOODS_DESTRUCTIBLECAR_ATTACKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1879007178" "So my wife said I needed therapy.  This is better than any anger management class out there!"
// STEEL_ALLHOODS_DESTRUCTIBLECAR_ATTACKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P709367584" "Make sure there is no evidence left!"
// STEEL_ALLHOODS_DESTRUCTIBLECAR_ATTACKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2659193039" "This will teach him a lesson!"
// STEEL_ALLHOODS_DESTRUCTIBLECAR_ATTACKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P905285237" "How many more cars we gotta destroy for the boss today?"
// STEEL_ALLHOODS_DESTRUCTIBLECAR_ATTACKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2855611709" "They're gonna see what happens when you mess with the Family!"
// STEEL_ALLHOODS_DESTRUCTIBLECAR_ATTACKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1196349190" "Disrespect MY family and see what happens!"

